<title>USA: Wellman Inc Q1 sales, net and share fall.</title>
<headline>Wellman Inc Q1 sales, net and share fall.</headline>
<dateline>SHREWSBURY, N.J. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>							 First Quarter</p>
<p>							 ending March 31,</p>
<p>							     1997    1996</p>
<p> Net sales					     $255.1  $301.0</p>
<p> Cost of sales					  215.2   256.4</p>
<p> Gross profit					    39.9    44.6</p>
<p> Selling, general &amp; administrative expenses    21.4    22.0</p>
<p> Operating income					18.6    22.7</p>
<p> Interest expense, net				  3.3     3.9</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes			15.3    18.8</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes			   6.6     7.0</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)				    8.7    11.7</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss) per common share	    0.28    0.35</p>
<p> Average common shares(a)			    31.1    33.7</p>
<p>NOTES: (a) The company repurchased 2.5 million shares, or</p>
<p>7.5%, of its outstanding common stock in the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
